<h2>Sirup Alang-alang</h2>
Sirup Alang-alang.
Alang-alang kalebu tuwuhan kang bisa kanggo &lt;a href="obat"&gt;obat&lt;/a&gt;. Mula iku alang-alang diolah dadi &lt;a href="sirup"&gt;sirup&lt;/a&gt;. Sirup alang-alang saliyané bisa dadi obat kang nyéhatakè, uga duwé rasa kang énak. Sirup alang-alang uga bisa didol lan ngasilaké &lt;a href="dhuwit"&gt;dhuwit&lt;/a&gt;. Bahan kanggo nggawé sirup alang-alang ya iku &lt;a href="oyot"&gt;oyot&lt;/a&gt; alang-alang. Carané oyot alang-alang digaréngaké lan digodhog karo banyu, banjur dicampur &lt;a href="gula"&gt;gula&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="aren"&gt;aren&lt;/a&gt; lan bumbu bumbon crakèn kaya ta &lt;a href="ja%C3%A9"&gt;jaé&lt;/a&gt; abang. Sawisé iku alang-alang digodhog nganti rada kenthel, banjur sirup alang-alang diadhemké. Kanggo nggawé sirup alang-alang cukup dicampur karo &lt;a href="banyu"&gt;banyu&lt;/a&gt; supaya ora kekenthelen. Yèn arep didol jladrenan &lt;a href="sirup"&gt;sirup&lt;/a&gt; alang-alang banjur diwadhahi &lt;a href="gendul"&gt;gendul&lt;/a&gt;.
<h4>Jamu ora kudu pait</h4>
Jamu ora kudu pait.
&lt;a href="Jamu"&gt;Jamu&lt;/a&gt; lumrahé rasané &lt;a href="pait"&gt;pait&lt;/a&gt; Béda karo alang-alang, sirup jamu saka alang-alang bisa digawé warna-warna rasané gumantung sing nggawé, saéngga &lt;a href="jamu"&gt;jamu&lt;/a&gt; kang wujud &lt;a href="sirup"&gt;sirup&lt;/a&gt; iki &lt;a href="rasa"&gt;rasa&lt;/a&gt;né &lt;a href="seger"&gt;seger&lt;/a&gt; lan énak, ora &lt;a href="pait"&gt;pait&lt;/a&gt;. Nanging sanajan énak rasané &lt;a href="jamu"&gt;jamu&lt;/a&gt; iki têtêp nyéhataké awak kaya jamu-jamu &lt;a href="tradhisional"&gt;tradhisional&lt;/a&gt; liyané. Sirup alang-alang, bisa digawé variasi rasané kaya sirup liya-liyané. Umpamané rasa &lt;a href="strob%C3%A9ry"&gt;strobéry&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="jeruk"&gt;jeruk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="pala"&gt;pala&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="jahe"&gt;jahe&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="kawis"&gt;kawis&lt;/a&gt;, lan liya-liyané.
