Nikita Khrushchev

<ol>
<li>ALIH</<li>
</ol>
Nikita Sergeyevich Khrushchev (#ALIH) punika satunggiling nagarawan &lt;a href="Uni%20Sovy%C3%A8t"&gt;Uni Sovyèt&lt;/a&gt;. Sasampunipun tilar donyanipun &lt;a href="Josef%20Stalin"&gt;Stalin&lt;/a&gt; lan parebatan kakuwaosan, panjenenganipun mengku kalungguhan minangka Sekjen Parté Kuminis Uni Sovyèt wiwit taun &lt;a href="1953"&gt;1953&lt;/a&gt; dumugi &lt;a href="1964"&gt;1964&lt;/a&gt;, lan minangka Mahamantri wiwit taun &lt;a href="1958"&gt;1958&lt;/a&gt; dumugi &lt;a href="1964"&gt;1964&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika taun 1964 panjenenganipun dipunlèngsèraken déning &lt;a href="Part%C3%A9%20Kuminis%20Uni%20Sovy%C3%A8t"&gt;Parté Kuminis&lt;/a&gt; lan dipungantosaken déning &lt;a href="Leonid%20Brezhnev"&gt;Leonid Brezhnev&lt;/a&gt;
Khruschev kathah ngritik gaya Stalin salebetipun mimpin Uni Sovyèt, saéngga sapérangan pendhèrèk Stalin boten patiya remen kaliyan panjenenganipun.
Kawicaksanan-kawicaksanan wigatos salaminipun papréntahan Khrushchev ing Sovyèt.
<ul>
<li>Taun 1955 madegaken &lt;a href="Pakta%20Warsawa"&gt;Pakta Warsawa&lt;/a&gt;, minangka tandhingan kanggé &lt;a href="NATO"&gt;NATO&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>Taun 1956 militèr Uni Sovyèt &lt;a href="R%C3%A9volusi%20Hungaria"&gt;ngintervènsi Hungaria&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>Nyengkuyung &lt;a href="Mesir"&gt;Mesir&lt;/a&gt; salaminipun &lt;a href="Krisis%20Terusan%20Suez"&gt;Krisis Terusan Suez&lt;/a&gt; taun 1956</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Perpecahan%20Tiongkok-Sovy%C3%A8t"&gt;Perpecahan Tiongkok-Sovyèt&lt;/a&gt; minangka akibat negosiasinipun Krushchev kaliyan nagari-nagari kilèn lan nulak nulung program akasa Cina</li>
<li>Miwiti &lt;a href="program%20akasa%20Sovy%C3%A8t"&gt;program akasa Sovyèt&lt;/a&gt;, ingkang kasil ngintun &lt;a href="satelit"&gt;satelit&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Sputnik"&gt;Sputnik&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="kosmonot"&gt;kosmonot&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Yuri%20Gagarin"&gt;Yuri Gagarin&lt;/a&gt; dhumateng njawi akasa.</li>
<li>Nyarujuki pambangunan &lt;a href="T%C3%A8mbok%20Berlin"&gt;Tèmbok Berlin&lt;/a&gt; ing taun &lt;a href="1961"&gt;1961&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>Manggènaken &lt;a href="rudal"&gt;rudal-rudal&lt;/a&gt; nuklir ing &lt;a href="Kuba"&gt;Kuba&lt;/a&gt;, saéngga micu &lt;a href="Krisis%20Rudal%20Kuba"&gt;Krisis Rudal Kuba&lt;/a&gt; ing taun &lt;a href="1962"&gt;1962&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
</ul>
