Lobster

Lobster banyu tawar utawa Freshwater Crayfish kalebu salah siji jinis &lt;a href="k%C3%A9wan%20akuatik"&gt;kéwan akuatik&lt;/a&gt; saka kulawarga &lt;a href="Astacidae"&gt;Astacidae&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Cambaridae"&gt;Cambaridae&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Parastacidae"&gt;Parastacidae&lt;/a&gt;.
Ing &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt;, wiwit taun &lt;a href="1991"&gt;1991&lt;/a&gt; Lobster banyu tawar minangka &lt;a href="rerenggan"&gt;rerenggan&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Anatomi utawa Pérangan Tubuh</h2>
Anatomi utawa Pérangan Tubuh.
Miturut &lt;a href="morfologi"&gt;morfologi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="sp%C3%A9sies-sp%C3%A9sies"&gt;spésies-spésies&lt;/a&gt; lobster banyu tawar kalebu &lt;a href="g%C3%A9nus%20Cherax"&gt;génus Cherax&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="famili%0Aparastacidae"&gt;famili
parastacidae&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="ordodecapoda"&gt;ordodecapoda&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="kelas%20malacostraca"&gt;kelas malacostraca&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="subfilum%20crustacea"&gt;subfilum crustacea&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="filum%20arthopoda"&gt;filum arthopoda&lt;/a&gt;.
Lumrahé lobster banyu tawar duwé titikan &lt;a href="morfologi"&gt;morfologi&lt;/a&gt; tubuh kang kapérang dadi loro,
ya iku &lt;a href="sirah"&gt;sirah&lt;/a&gt; (chepalothorax) lan &lt;a href="awak"&gt;awak&lt;/a&gt;(abdomen). Antarané &lt;a href="sirah"&gt;sirah&lt;/a&gt; ngarep lan &lt;a href="sirah"&gt;sirah&lt;/a&gt; buri dikenal kanthi sebutan &lt;a href="sub-chepalothorax"&gt;sub-chepalothorax&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Cangkang"&gt;Cangkang&lt;/a&gt; kang nutupi &lt;a href="sirah"&gt;sirah&lt;/a&gt; diarani &lt;a href="karapak"&gt;karapak&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="%28carapace%29"&gt;(carapace)&lt;/a&gt; kang tugasé ngayomi organ tubuh kaya ta &lt;a href="utek"&gt;utek&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href="angsang"&gt;angsang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="ati"&gt;ati&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="lambung"&gt;lambung&lt;/a&gt;. Titikan liyané ya iku &lt;a href="rostrum"&gt;rostrum&lt;/a&gt; kang mèmper &lt;a href="segitiga"&gt;segitiga&lt;/a&gt; papak, amba, lan ana &lt;a href="eri"&gt;eri&lt;/a&gt; ing kiwa tengené &lt;a href="rostrum"&gt;rostrum&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Jinis Lobster</h2>
<ol>
<li>&lt;a href="Cherax%20Dustructor"&gt;Cherax Dustructor&lt;/a&gt;, ya iku jinis lobster sing paling misuwur ing &lt;a href="Australia"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt;. Lobster jinis iki bisa urip kanthi cara nggawé bolongan kang jeroné bisa nganti &lt;a href="5"&gt;5&lt;/a&gt; mèter.</<li>
<li>&lt;a href="Cherax%20Quadricarinatus"&gt;Cherax Quadricarinatus&lt;/a&gt;, luwih misuwur kanthi jejuluk &lt;a href="Redclaw"&gt;Redclaw&lt;/a&gt;. Diarani &lt;a href="Redclaw"&gt;Redclaw&lt;/a&gt; amarga capité rupa &lt;a href="abang"&gt;abang&lt;/a&gt;. Nduwéni jeneng latin &lt;a href="Quadricarinatus"&gt;Quadricarinatus&lt;/a&gt; kang tegesé patang lunas utawa papat lunas (quadri=papat, carinatus=carinae, wujudé kaya lunas)</<li>
<li>&lt;a href="Procambarus%20Claarkii"&gt;Procambarus Claarkii&lt;/a&gt;, Lobster jinis iki asalé saka laladan &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Utara"&gt;Amérika Utara&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Lousiana"&gt;Lousiana&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Delta%20Missisippi"&gt;Delta Missisippi&lt;/a&gt;. Warna dominan saka lobster iki wujud &lt;a href="abang"&gt;abang&lt;/a&gt;. Lobster jinis iki duwé sipat &lt;a href="agresif"&gt;agresif&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href="teritorial"&gt;teritorial&lt;/a&gt; lan doyan mangan.</<li>
</ol>
