<doc id="72088" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=72088" title="The Times">
The Times

The Times iku &lt;a href="koran"&gt;koran&lt;/a&gt; dinan kang diterbitaké ing &lt;a href="Britania%20Raya"&gt;Britania Raya&lt;/a&gt; wiwit taun &lt;a href="1785"&gt;1785&lt;/a&gt;, nalika iku isih ditepungi kanthi jeneng The Daily Universal Register.
Koran iki lan seduluré &lt;a href="The%20Sunday%20Times"&gt;The Sunday Times&lt;/a&gt; diterbitaké déning Times Newspapers Limited, kang wujud péranganing &lt;a href="News%20International"&gt;News International&lt;/a&gt;. News International diduwèni kabèh déning golongan &lt;a href="News%20Corporation"&gt;News Corporation&lt;/a&gt;, kang dibawahi &lt;a href="Rupert%20Murdoch"&gt;Rupert Murdoch&lt;/a&gt;. Sanajan lumrahé koran iki cukup modherat &lt;a href="Political%20Compass"&gt;centre-right&lt;/a&gt; lan panyengkuyungé golongan &lt;a href="Part%C3%A9%20Konservatif%20%28UK%29"&gt;Konservatif&lt;/a&gt;, nanging koran iki tau nyengkuyung golongan &lt;a href="Part%C3%A9%20Buruh%20%28UK%29"&gt;Parté Buruh&lt;/a&gt; nalika taun &lt;a href="2001"&gt;2001&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="2005"&gt;2005&lt;/a&gt; nalika ajang &lt;a href="pammilihan%20umum"&gt;pammilihan umum&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika taun &lt;a href="2005"&gt;2005&lt;/a&gt;, dhedhasar data saka &lt;a href="MORI"&gt;MORI&lt;/a&gt;, olèh data yèn 40% saka para pamacané iku panyengkuyungé Parté Konservatif, 29% panyengkuyung &lt;a href="Dh%C3%A9mokrat%20Liberal"&gt;Dhémokrat Liberal&lt;/a&gt;, 26% panyengkuyung Parté Buruh.
The Times iku jeneng asli saka koran iki, lan nyilihaké jenengé marang manéka korang ing sapérangan panjuru donya, kaya déné &lt;a href="The%20New%20York%20Times"&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="The%20Times%20of%20India"&gt;The Times of India&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="The%20Irish%20Times"&gt;The Irish Times&lt;/a&gt;. Kanggo luwih mirunggan, yèn diterbitaké kanggo laladan ing njaba UK minangka London Times. Koran iki asliné migunakaké jinis huruf &lt;a href="Times%20New%20Roman"&gt;Times New Roman&lt;/a&gt;, kang dikembangaké déning &lt;a href="Stanley%20Morison"&gt;Stanley Morison&lt;/a&gt; saka The Times kerjasama karo &lt;a href="Monotype%20Corporation"&gt;Monotype Corporation&lt;/a&gt; kang wis misuwur babagan panyithakané.
Koran iki diterbitaké sajeroning wangun &lt;a href="broadsheet"&gt;broadsheet&lt;/a&gt; kanggo punjul 200 taun, nanging diowahi dadi wangun &lt;a href="Compact%20%28koran%29"&gt;compact&lt;/a&gt; nalika taun &lt;a href="2004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt; minangka laku kanggo ngranggèh para pamaca enom. &lt;a href="M%C3%A8i"&gt;Mèi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;, diwara-warakaké bakal diterbitaké edisi &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, kang wiwit diédharaké tanggal &lt;a href="6%20Juni"&gt;6 Juni&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Hari ini</h2>
Hari ini.
Rega kang dicantumké ing koran iki ing &lt;a href="Inggris%20Raya"&gt;Inggris Raya&lt;/a&gt; iku 70p (70 &lt;a href="penny"&gt;penny&lt;/a&gt;) suwéné dina kerja (mundhak 5p wiwit &lt;a href="3%20September"&gt;3 September&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt;), 30p kanggo para mahasiswa kang didol kanthi mirunggan saka kios-kois &lt;a href="mahasiswa"&gt;mahasiswa&lt;/a&gt; lan £1.40 ing dina &lt;a href="Setu"&gt;Setu&lt;/a&gt; (wiwit &lt;a href="8%20September"&gt;8 September&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt;). Koran seduluré, &lt;a href="The%20Sunday%20Times"&gt;The Sunday Times&lt;/a&gt;, isih duwé format &lt;a href="broadsheet"&gt;broadsheet&lt;/a&gt;. Sanajan The Times lan The Sunday Times, kaloroné diduwèni News International, sawijining anak perusahaan saka Rupert Murdoch's Newscorp, kaloroné ora silih bagi punggawa ing babagan éditorial, lan diyasa kapisah lan mung andum pamilik waé wiwit &lt;a href="1967"&gt;1967&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika sasi &lt;a href="November"&gt;November&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt; The Times wiwit nyithak judhulé sajeroning wangun huruf anyar, &lt;a href="Times%20New%20Roman%23The%20Times%20versions"&gt;Times Modhèrn&lt;/a&gt;.
<h3>Sirkulasi</h3>
Sirkulasi.
Adhedasar data kang bisa ditanggungjawabaké &lt;a href="Sirkulasi%20koran"&gt;angka sirkulasi&lt;/a&gt; kanggo sasi &lt;a href="November"&gt;November&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2005"&gt;2005&lt;/a&gt; nuduhaké yèn The Times kang kaadol gunggungé 692,581 èkspemplar saben dinané. Iki panggayuhan kang paling dhuwur wiwit koran iki dibawahi éditor, &lt;a href="Robert%20James%20Thomson"&gt;Robert Thomson&lt;/a&gt;, lan nyakinaké yèn koran iki tetep bakal dadi kang paling ngarep saka The Daily Telegraph sajeroning total pangadolané, sanajan &lt;a href="The%20Daily%20Telegraph"&gt;The Daily Telegraph&lt;/a&gt; tetep dadi kang palng ngarep ing pasar, kanggo broadsheets, kanthi sirkulasi ora kurang saka 905,955 èksemplar. Koran wangun tabloid, kaya déné &lt;a href="The%20Sun%20%28koran%29"&gt;The Sun&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Daily%20Mail"&gt;Daily Mail&lt;/a&gt;, saiki kasil adol kanthi sirkulasi ora kurang saka 3,274,855 lan 2,353,807.
