Asam kandis utawa Garcinia xanthochymus iku kulawarga saka Garcinia namung &lt;a href="sp%C3%A9sies"&gt;spésies&lt;/a&gt;é kang béda, rasané rada pait. Rupané kaya ta &lt;a href="jamur"&gt;jamur&lt;/a&gt; shitake, warnané ireng kesoklatan lan racaké dimanfatké manawa wis garing.Asliné bunder-bunder cilik,nanging barang disigar &lt;a href="wiji"&gt;wiji&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="uwoh"&gt;uwoh&lt;/a&gt;e dibuang, rasané asem pait bisa kanggo nggantékaké &lt;a href="asem%20Jawa"&gt;asem Jawa&lt;/a&gt;
Asem kandis kagolong &lt;a href="asem"&gt;asem&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="asem"&gt;asem&lt;/a&gt;an kang padatané kanggo masak lan dadi sumberé bahan baku &lt;a href="asem"&gt;asem&lt;/a&gt; ning olah-olahan &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt; kang waneka warna, &lt;a href="asem"&gt;asem&lt;/a&gt; saliyané asem kandis ana &lt;a href="asem%20jawa"&gt;asem jawa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="asem%20sunti"&gt;asem sunti&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="asem%20glugur"&gt;asem glugur&lt;/a&gt;.
Asem kandis ning laladan &lt;a href="Sumatra"&gt;Sumatra&lt;/a&gt; biasané kanggo bumbu masak.
Asem kandis isih sak kulawarga karo &lt;a href="manggis"&gt;manggis&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="asem%20gelugur"&gt;asem gelugur&lt;/a&gt;
